WEBVTT

00:01:29.054 --> 00:01:30.500
Why?

00:01:30.524 --> 00:01:32.448
Because over the last 20 or 30 years,

00:01:32.472 --> 00:01:36.282
much of the world has gone
from being complicated

00:01:36.306 --> 00:01:37.602
to being complex --

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:40.714
which means that yes, there are patterns,

00:01:40.738 --> 00:01:43.034
but they don't repeat
themselves regularly.

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:47.728
It means that very small changes
can make a disproportionate impact.

00:01:48.244 --> 00:01:50.910
And it means that expertise
won't always suffice,

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:54.568
because the system
just keeps changing too fast.

00:01:56.192 --> 00:01:58.824
So what that means

00:01:58.848 --> 00:02:01.735
is that there's a huge amount in the world